    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'v'ezya ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'ezyaga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo ku' mbawo zya muti' gwa mugu'nga. Ihozezyo lyeni'lo lyav'age lya mugelani'lo, wu'lihu walyo na wu'gali'nhu walyo mita iv'i'li' na lobo, na wi'i'ma walyo mita yi'mo na lobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wav'ezyaga mapembe ane ga mu mapembo galyo ane nago gav'aga ki'ntu' ki'mo na ihozezyo lyeni'ki'li'. Ihozezyo lyose wali'kumbi'laga shaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wav'ezyaga vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose ku' shaba: mafuli'la ga ku'sini'zya matunde, mayolelo ga ku'kokotela ha ihozezyo, mabakuli, wuma zya ku'timi'la nyama na sahani zya ku'lapu'li'la moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'ezyaga wavu wa shaba, na ku'wu'tu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na leli ya ihozezyo mpaka wafikaga hagati' yalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasulaga pete ine zya shaba, ku' ki'la ipembo pete yi'mo, ku'nguno ya ku'dimi'zya miti' zya ku'li'sombela ihozezyo lyeni'lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wav'ezyaga miti' zyeni'zyo zya mugu'nga na ku'zikumbi'la shaba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na waziswekaga mu pete i'zyo zyav'age mu mbazu zya lyeni'lo ihozezyo ku'nguno ya ku'li'sombela. Wav'ezyaga ihozezyo i'lo li'li' na nkululi mugati' ku' ku'tu'mi'la mbawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wav'ezyaga ikalaye lya shaba na kikali'lo chalyo cha shaba. Ikalaye lyeni'lo lyav'eziv'agwa ku' ku'tu'mi'la vintu' vya shaba i'vyo vili'yekema ki'ti' malole i'vyo ndi' v'afumya v'aki'ma av'o v'atu'mamage ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'zyenga lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema Isondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wav'ezyaga lu'gu'tu'. Lwandi' lwa ku' dakama kwav'age na miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu' i'zyo ziv'eziv'ilwe ku' katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyav'age na wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi ane na ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhi'ngi' zyazyo zyav'age maku'mi av'i'li' na vikali'lo vya shaba maku'mi av'i'li'. Nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' zyeni'zyo haki'mo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyene vivyo na lwandi' lwa ku' sukuma wu'lihu wa miki'ngo wav'age mita maku'mi ane na ine, na nhi'ngi' zyazyo maku'mi av'i'li' na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi av'i'li' vya shaba. Hangi' nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwandi' lwa ku' mweli lwav'age na miki'ngo zya wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li', na nhi'ngi' zyazyo iku'mi na vikali'lo vyazyo iku'mi. Nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwandi' lwa ku' ki'ya, u'ko kwav'age na wingi'li'lo, lu'gu'tu' lwav'age na wu'gali'nhu wa mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miki'ngo zya ku' lwandi' lu'mo lwa wingi'li'lo zyav'age na wu'lihu wa mita mukaga na nusu, haki'mo na nhi'ngi' idatu' na vikali'lo vyazyo vidatu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyene vivyo ku' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li' lwa wingi'li'lo miki'ngo zyav'age na wu'lihu wa mita mukaga na nusu, haki'mo na nhi'ngi' zyazyo idatu' na vikali'lo vyazyo vidatu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miki'ngo zyose i'zyo zipilimile lu'gu'tu' zyav'age zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vikali'lo vya nhi'ngi' vyav'age vya shaba, sumbwa nkontozyo zyazyo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. Mitwe zyazyo zyav'age zikumbi'lilwe feza, hangi' nhi'ngi' zyose zya lu'gu'tu' zyazwi'kagwa pete zya mawe ga feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo weni'ki'li' wa lu'gu'tu' gwav'age gu'pu'ndilwe visoga na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Muki'ngo gwenu'go gwav'age na wu'gali'nhu wa mita kenda, na wi'i'ma wago mita iv'i'li', ku'gelani'la na i'zyo miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhi'ngi' zyago zyav'age ine na vikali'lo vyazyo vine vya shaba. Nkontozyo zyazyo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza, na mitwe zyazyo zyav'age zikumbi'lilwe feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmambo zyose zya Ihema Isondo na zya lu'gu'tu' u'lo lu'li'pilimile ihema zyav'age zya shaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mawe ga mupango ku'nguno ya Ihema Isondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'gu' hu' mwilondo gwa mawe ga mupango ago gatu'mi'ka ku' ku'li'zyenga Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Wu'sangi'lwa. Mwilondo gwenu'gu' gwiv'angagwa na V'alawi ki'ti' i'vyo Mose ndi' walagi'li'zya, ku' wi'mi'li'zi wamwa Itamali, mwana wa muhozya Aloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bezaleli, mwana wamwa Uli, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Huli, wa igongo lya Yuda, ndi' wav'ezya ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamulagi'li'zya Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagwasiv'agwa na Oholiabu, mwana wamwa Ahisamaki, wa igongo lya Dani, u'yo ali' fundi wa ki'la muli'mo, mumanyi wa kwiganika ki'v'ezezye, na mupu'ndi ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa na katani nsoga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zahabu yose i'yo ndi' yatu'mi'ka ku' mili'mo zya hantu' hasondo yav'age yi'li' na wu'timbu wa kilo ki'hu'mbi' ki'mo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kilo ki'hu'mbi' ki'mo ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' talanta maku'mi av'i'li' na kenda na shekeli magana mupungati' na maku'mi adatu'.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ku'londana na vipimo i'vyo vitu'u'lilwe ha hantu' hasondo. Zahabu yeni'yo hu' i'yo ndi' yawu'siwa ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mawe ga feza ago ndi' gigela ku' v'enav'o v'antu' v'a iv'ilingano av'o ndi' v'asoloziwa ndi' ga wu'timbu wa kilo vihu'mbi' vidatu' na magana ane na maku'mi adatu', ku'londana na vipimo vya hantu' hasondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la mugosya u'yo ndi' wasoloziwa ku'fuma musimo gwa myaka maku'mi av'i'li' ninga ku'ki'la, ndi' wafumya lu'sogo lwakwe lwa feza gilamu mukaga, ku'londana na vipimo vya hantu' hasondo. V'agosya v'ose av'o ndi' v'asoloziwa v'av'age laki mukaga na vihu'mbi' vidatu' na magana atano na maku'mi atano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilo vihu'mbi' vidatu' na magana ane zya mawe ga feza ndi' zyatu'mi'ka ku'suli'la vikali'lo igana li'mo vya hantu' hasondo na vya u'go muki'ngo gwa mugati', yaani kilo maku'mi adatu' na ine ku' ki'la kikali'lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'zyo kilo maku'mi adatu' i'zyo ndi' zyasigali'la, ndi' zyatu'mi'ka ku'v'ezezya nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na ku'zikumbi'la feza mitwe zya nhi'ngi' na ku'ziv'ezezya pete zya ku'zwi'ka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaba i'yo V'aizilaeli ndi' v'ayi'wu'sya ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yav'age na wu'timbu wa kilo vihu'mbi' viv'i'li' na magana ane na maku'mi av'i'li' na itano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaba yeni'yo ndi' yatu'mi'ka ku'v'ezezya vikali'lo vya nhi'ngi' zya ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ihozezyo lya shaba, haki'mo na u'wo wavu walyo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 38:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vikali'lo vya nhi'ngi' zya lu'gu'tu' u'lo lu'li'pilimile ihema na zya ha wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu', na mmambo zyose zya Ihema Isondo haki'mo na zya lu'gu'tu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.38.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.38.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
